    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Readme'>
      <repository-location id='Readme' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/BIenginesavings' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1000' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1000' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7500' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Readme </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='16'>for BigQuery On Demand projects: Cost comparison vs BI engine</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='90900' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='8300'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Summary</run>
              <run>&#10;This dashboard aims to provide a comparison of per (processed) terabyte costs for BigQuery projects running on-demand billing vs those that also have the BI engine feature ( </run>
              <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/bi-engine-intro&amp;quot;'>https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/bi-engine-intro</run>
              <run> ) enabled.&#10;</run>
              <run italic='true'>Using this feature on some of our most expensive on demand billing projects could reduce annual BigQuery costs by ~300K.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Assumption</run>
              <run>&#10;Queries running on projects where BI engine is not currently enabled are directly running against rl tables. Although those will gain the most -- both in terms of performance and lower cost -- it would still be valuable to enable BI engine on some of the projects with &gt;3K in monthly costs to find the optimum configuration.&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Methodology</run>
              <run>&#10;- Only </run>
              <run italic='true'>Analysis </run>
              <run>and </run>
              <run italic='true'>BigQuery BI Engine for US</run>
              <run> costs are included. All other GCP project costs are irrelevant for this exercise.&#10;- Query statistics (number of queries, processed and billed terabytes etc.) are fetched from finops table </run>
              <run italic='true'>billing_bigquery</run>
              <run>. (see query below)&#10;- In order to estimate potential savings for each project if BI engine were enabled, we:&#10;    a. Assume the same per TB costs as other projects with BI engine enabled. For this, we only consider projects with at least 30% costs coming from BI engine. The rationale for this is some projects have BI engine enabled, but are not optimized so their per TB cost is actually higher.&#10;    b. If total cost from step a above is lower than 25 USD per day, we at least assume that minimum cost. This is because it&apos;s difficult to achieve cost efficiency using BI engine on projects with both fewer overall queries executed, and low overall processed TB.&#10;        i. ~25 USD per day calculated based on BI engine pricing of $0.0416 per GiB per hour with 25 GB of reservation.&#10;        ii. For comparison, Logistics uses 40GiB reservation on a project that runs ~1M queries per month, all against rl tables directly.&#10;        iii. It is likely that most projects can make do with 5 to 10 GiB reservation. Some will benefit from a larger reservation size, with even lower Cost per TB.&#10;    c. Lastly, the potential savings calculation takes a conservative approach by ignoring those projects where a minimum of 500 USD per month in savings isn&apos;t projected.&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Query</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>create</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>or</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>replace</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>table</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>logistics-data-storage-staging.sandbox_ankur.on_demand_gcp_projects_query_costs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>partition</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>by</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>created_date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>cluster</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>by</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>project_id</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>as</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>with</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>costs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>as</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>select</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>project_id</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>    , </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>created_date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>    , </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>round</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>sum</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>cost</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#f4511e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>1</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>as</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>total_cost</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>    , </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>round</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>sum</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>case</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>when</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>resource</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'> = </run>
              <run fontcolor='#0d904f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>&apos;BigQuery BI Engine for US&apos;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>then</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>cost</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>else</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#f4511e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>0</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>end</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#f4511e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>1</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>as</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>cost_bi_engine</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>    , </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>max</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>(</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>case</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#3367d6' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>when</run>
              <run fontcolor='#3a474e' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Mono,Menlo,Monaco,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='7'>resource</run>
